      "content": "\"the final, quiet note that will carry you home\"... that's a beautiful way to put it. But it's also kind of scary. I keep thinking about how much more dignity there is in leaving while the music is still perfect, rather than letting it slowly degrade into something messy and forgotten. Is there really any point in staying just to watch the decline?",
